2	line	Player	I'm in search of a man named Avan Fitzharmon.
2	line	Gem trader	Fitzharmon eh? Hmmm.... If I'm not mistaken that's the family name of a member of the Varrockian nobility. You know, I HAVE seen someone of that
2	line	Gem trader	persuasion around here recently... Wearing a poncey yellow cape he was! Came in here all la-di-dah, high and mighty, asking for jewelry made
2	line	Gem trader	from 'perfect gold' - whatever that is - like 'normal' golds just not good enough for little lord fancy pants there! I told him to head to the desert
2	line	Gem trader	'Cos I know theres gold out there, in them there sand dunes... and if it's not up to his lordships high standards of 'gold perfection'...
2	line	Gem trader	Maybe we'll all get lucky and the scorpions will deal with him.
