0	section	Talking to Avan
1	select	Select an option
1	option	Why are you hanging around a in a scorpion pit?
2	line	Player	Why are you lurking around a scorpion pit?
2	line	Man	It's a good place to find gold...
2	action	end
1	option	I'm looking for a man named Avan Fitzharmon
2	line	Player	I'm looking for a man... his name is Avan Fitzharmon.
2	line	Man	Then you have found him. My name is Avan Fitzharmon.
2	line	Player	You have a part of your family crest. I am on a quest to retrieve all of the fragmented pieces and restore the crest.
2	line	Man	Ha! I suppose one of my worthless brothers has sent you on this quest then?
2	line	Player	No, it was your father who has asked me to do this for him.
2	line	Man	My... my father wishes this? Then that is a different matter. I will let you have my crest shard, adventurer, but you must first do something for me.
2	line	Man	There is a certain lady I am trying to impress. As a man of noble birth, I can not give her just any old trinket to show my devotion. What I intend to give her, is a golden ring, embedded with the finest precious red
2	line	Man	stone available, and a necklace to match this ring.
2	line	Man	The problem however for me, is that not just any old gold will be suitable. I seek only the purest, the most high quality of gold - what I seek, if you will, is perfect gold.
2	line	Man	None of the gold around here is even remotely suitable in terms of quality. I have searched far and wide for the perfect gold I desire, but have had no success so in finding it.
2	line	Man	If you can find me my perfect gold, make a ring and necklace from it, and add rubies to them, I will gladly hand over my fragment of the family crest to you.
2	line	Player	Can you give me any help on finding this 'perfect gold'?
2	line	Man	I thought I had found a solid lead on its whereabouts when I heard of a dwarf who is an expert on gold who goes by the name of 'Boot'.
2	line	Man	Unfortunately he has apparently returned to his home, somewhere under Ice Mountain, and I have no idea how to find him.
2	line	Player	Well, I'll see what I can do.
2	action	end
0	section	Talking to Avan again
1	line	Avan	So how are you doing getting me my perfect gold jewellery?
1	line	Player	I'm still after that 'perfect gold'.
1	line	Avan	I know how you feel... for such a long time I have searched and searched for the elusive perfect gold... I thought I had gotten a good lead on finding it when I heard talk of a dwarven expert on gold some time back.
1	line	Avan	His name was Boot. Unfortunately for me, he has apparently returned to his home under Ice Mountain, and I cannot find him.
1	action	end
